OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain spreads
OL,6,Fsoutheastwards overnight, reaching
OL,7,Fmost areas before easing in places.
OL,8,FSome heavy bursts are possible, while
OL,9,Fthe far northeast stays wet for
OL,10,Flonger. Cloudy conditions continue
OL,11,Fwith scattered drizzly showers,
OL,12,Fbecoming breezy in the north and west.
OL,13,FMild throughout.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FA wet start across many
OL,16,Fnorthern and central areas of the
OL,17,Fcountry, with rain moving erratically
OL,18,Fsouthwards during the day. Turning
OL,19,Fbrighter but fresher from the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
